        "title": "Aniu Nagamei ram kum gaimei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Aniu Nagamei ram kum gaimei makge,",
            "Njianmei ruprian guai ta jao puki;",
            "Khouring, nruaina kajat guai khuan gai e,",
            "Hei kummei ramgai )_3 meiguai lung tithao e.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Gaichang e aniu lungpui ram hei,",
            "Gaimei rana padik ge;",
            "Kagan kathui aniu lungpui ramTihei thuan e,",
            "Kagan kathui aniu chun chamma lung e,",
            "Gaichange Nagamei aniu lungpui ramhei.",
            "",
            "2. Ntheih thei nung aniu pou-pei kin khou mu,",
            "Khat khatta sangna rih su bam khuan e;",
            "Ntau aniu alaunun kin khou mu,",
            "Guang kandih kumma aniu kandihta thuan e.",
            "",
            "3. Aniu pou-pei )_3 lung lou dumei ram hei,",
            "Chamdan chui bammo kandih pri si e;",
            "Raguang jan khou aniu ramta thuan bamni,",
            "Raguang )_3 aniu thou tan khang ndiulou e.",
            "",
            "4. Kara gaimei tingthai kum Nagamei ram,",
            "Kagan thui tajei dui gaimei kum e;",
            "Aniu Nagamei guai dui kum luang bam e,",
            "Aniu Nagamei ramta phut laknga bam e.",
            "",
            "5. Aniu pou-pei )_3 khamloumei ram pang khou,",
            "Nagamei ram kummei gaimei makge;",
            "Duipi duibah thangmei guai )_3 juan guang e,",
            "Miram gaimei lunlung kummei guai neila e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
